{
 "title": "The Borrower",
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "l01",
   "who": "TEN-TEN",
   "text": "[leans in] This watch costs three and a half thousand francs. [pause] And there's no name on it.",
   "caption": {
    "three and a half thousand francs.": "CHF 3,500."
   },
   "emph": [
    "CHF",
    "3,500.",
    "no",
    "name"
   ],
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "l02",
   "who": "DOT",
   "text": "[gasps] Wait. Who made it?!",
   "emph": [
    "Who"
   ],
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "id": "l03",
   "who": "TEN-TEN",
   "text": "[smugly] A man who couldn't afford watches.",
   "emph": [
    "couldn't"
   ],
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "id": "l04",
   "who": "TEN-TEN",
   "text": "Back then, the watches he loved were way beyond an intern's salary.",
   "emph": [
    "way",
    "beyond"
   ],
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "l05",
   "who": "TEN-TEN",
   "text": "So he borrowed them. From collectors.",
   "emph": [
    "borrowed"
   ],
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "l06",
   "who": "TEN-TEN",
   "text": "Photographed them. Studied them. Gave them back. [dry] A collection with return dates. Very sensible.",
   "emph": [
    "return",
    "dates.",
    "sensible."
   ],
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "id": "l07",
   "who": "DOT",
   "text": "[giggles] Can we do that?",
   "emph": [],
   "gap": 0.12
  },
  {
   "id": "l08",
   "who": "TEN-TEN",
   "text": "[flat] No.",
   "emph": [
    "No."
   ],
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "id": "l09",
   "who": "TEN-TEN",
   "text": "Photography became his career. All the way to Hasselblad, as Chief of Strategy.",
   "emph": [
    "Hasselblad,",
    "Strategy."
   ],
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "l10",
   "who": "DOT",
   "text": "[whispers] The camera people?!",
   "emph": [
    "camera"
   ],
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "id": "l11",
   "who": "TEN-TEN",
   "text": "In twenty seventeen, he made his own watches. And this one? Designed like a photograph. Light first.",
   "caption": {
    "twenty seventeen,": "2017,"
   },
   "emph": [
    "2017,",
    "Light",
    "first."
   ],
   "gap": 0.35
  },
  {
   "id": "l12",
   "who": "TEN-TEN",
   "text": "Watch.",
   "emph": [
    "Watch."
   ],
   "gap": 0.35
  },
  {
   "id": "l13",
   "who": "TEN-TEN",
   "text": "[softly] The markers are cut into the sapphire. They float above the hands.",
   "emph": [
    "sapphire.",
    "float"
   ],
   "gap": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "l14",
   "who": "TEN-TEN",
   "text": "[softly] It doesn't need a name. You know it in the dark.",
   "emph": [
    "dark."
   ],
   "gap": 0.35
